.TH cook-docs 1  "cook-docs v0.9.5" 
.SH NAME
cook\-docs \- cook\-docs automatically generates markdown documentation for cook recipes from template files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcook\-docs\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-jsonify\fR] [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-ignore\-file\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-recipe\-search\-root\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-log\-level\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-template\-files\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-word\-wrap\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-assets\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-ext\fR] [\fB\-\-emoji\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-weights\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-link\-dirs\fR] [\fB\-\-required\-metadata\fR] [\fB\-\-merge\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-watch\fR] [\fB\-\-debounce\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILES\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
cook\-docs automatically generates markdown documentation for cook recipes from template files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
version for cook\-docs
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR
path to configuration file (TOML, YAML, or JSON)
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
don\*(Aqt actually render any markdown files just print to stdout passed
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-jsonify\fR
parse the recipe and display it in json format
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-ignore\-file\fR
filename to use as an ignore file to exclude recipe directories (default ".cookdocsignore")
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-recipe\-search\-root\fR
directory to search recursively within for recipes (default ".")
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-log\-level\fR
level of logs that should printed, one of (panic, fatal, error, warning, info, debug, trace) (default "info")
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-template\-files\fR
gotemplate file paths relative to each recipe directory from which documentation will be generated (default "recipe.md.gotmpl")
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-word\-wrap\fR
word wrap line length for recipe steps section (default 120)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\-dir\fR
custom output directory to write generated markdown documentation
.TP
\fB\-\-assets\-dir\fR
optional directory to copy companion recipe images into (slug\-named)
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-ext\fR
optional image extension override for Info.ImageSlug (e.g. webp)
.TP
\fB\-\-emoji\-file\fR
optional YAML/TOML/JSON file mapping ingredients and cookware to emojis
.TP
\fB\-\-weights\-file\fR
optional YAML/TOML/JSON ingredient density file for toGrams volume\-to\-weight conversion
.TP
\fB\-\-link\-dirs\fR
comma\-separated recipe subdirectories eligible for linkRecipe cross\-linking
.TP
\fB\-\-required\-metadata\fR
comma\-separated metadata keys required by doctor \-\-check\-recipes (e.g. source,serves)
.TP
\fB\-\-merge\fR
merge generated content into existing Markdown files without clobbering manual edits
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
force full overwrite of existing Markdown files even when \-\-merge / merge is enabled
.TP
\fB\-\-watch\fR
watch recipes and templates and re\-render automatically on changes
.TP
\fB\-\-debounce\fR \fI<MS>\fR [default: 300]
debounce delay in milliseconds for watch mode (default 300)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILES\fR]
optional recipe files or subdirectories to render (mirrored relative to \-\-recipe\-search\-root)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
cook\-docs\-watch(1)
Watch recipes and templates and re\-render automatically on changes
.TP
cook\-docs\-completions(1)
Generate shell autocompletions script
.TP
cook\-docs\-man(1)
Generate UNIX roff man page
.TP
cook\-docs\-doctor(1)
Validate configuration, inputs, templates, and output permissions
.TP
cook\-docs\-self\-update(1)
Check for and install the latest cook\-docs release from GitHub
.TP
cook\-docs\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
vv0.9.5
